      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would only having a single deferred_free thread for every heap that uses deferred-free slow down the rate at which buffers get freed vs ION\u0027s implementation where there was one deferred-free thread per heap? I wonder if there would be any perf/system health implications due to that.",
